(2073547, 284583, 38032, '<td valign="top">Great idea  ...  the image even gives a feeling of vertigo!!!  why''d you have to beat me like that?    At first i thought the smoke was intedend to be like engine smoke from the contraption but then I realized -- a cloud obviously.  Anyway, I''m guessing you used a table and a huge topo map and a fog machine ??   Who has a map like that??  I like the attention to detail also -- the bump in the rug, the perfect direction of the tassels at either end.  I''m looking for something to keep this from being a 10. .... hmmm, you even pretty much used rule of thirds .. I can''t even say the shadows are off ... Alright 10 ... Congrats.</td>', 'Great idea  ...  the image even gives a feeling of vertigo!!!  why''d you have to beat me like that?    At first i thought the smoke was intedend to be like engine smoke from the contraption but then I realized -- a cloud obviously.  Anyway, I''m guessing you used a table and a huge topo map and a fog machine ??   Who has a map like that??  I like the attention to detail also -- the bump in the rug, the perfect direction of the tassels at either end.  I''m looking for something to keep this from being a 10. .... hmmm, you even pretty much used rule of thirds .. I can''t even say the shadows are off ... Alright 10 ... Congrats.', '2006-01-23 06:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
