(2073560, 283112, 6349, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.  I love the effect that the snow has given here and the guts it takes to take your camera out in the snow and get a shot like this.  The snow even makes the washed out sky work for me.  The pinkness of the umbrella in this cold bleak world adds to the uplifting theme nicely.  One of the top shots in the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful.  I love the effect that the snow has given here and the guts it takes to take your camera out in the snow and get a shot like this.  The snow even makes the washed out sky work for me.  The pinkness of the umbrella in this cold bleak world adds to the uplifting theme nicely.  One of the top shots in the challenge.', '2006-01-23 07:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
