(2073571, 283632, 6349, '<td valign="top">Perhaps the best photograph in the challenge from a portrature, technical point of view but I feel it may be lacking in the fantasy realm in that it seems more like a dress-up, model shoot, than an actual recreation of a specific fantasy or fantasy world.  However, it is still one of the best photos in the challenge and I expect it to score well.  I would just have liked to see something more engaging done with such a beautiful model, costume, and obvious technical and processing skills.</td>', 'Perhaps the best photograph in the challenge from a portrature, technical point of view but I feel it may be lacking in the fantasy realm in that it seems more like a dress-up, model shoot, than an actual recreation of a specific fantasy or fantasy world.  However, it is still one of the best photos in the challenge and I expect it to score well.  I would just have liked to see something more engaging done with such a beautiful model, costume, and obvious technical and processing skills.', '2006-01-23 07:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073577, 284153, 6349, '<td valign="top">Well done.  I''m going to take a guess and say that this will ribbon.  The colors have that wow impact that dpc loves, superman is something everyone will immediately know and relate to and there are other interesting aspects of this such as the anonymity and the inclusion of the weddingband with the bent steel leading to it as if to possibly suggest some connection, some meaning behing what truly makes a man of steel, to make this more than a pop off the screen image to be quickly passed by.</td>', 'Well done.  I''m going to take a guess and say that this will ribbon.  The colors have that wow impact that dpc loves, superman is something everyone will immediately know and relate to and there are other interesting aspects of this such as the anonymity and the inclusion of the weddingband with the bent steel leading to it as if to possibly suggest some connection, some meaning behing what truly makes a man of steel, to make this more than a pop off the screen image to be quickly passed by.', '2006-01-23 07:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073578, 283987, 6349, '<td valign="top">Love the angle, lines, and processing.  Hope this is not one of those photos that will be overlooked because it doesn''t meet everyone''s personal definition of fantasy.</td>', 'Love the angle, lines, and processing.  Hope this is not one of those photos that will be overlooked because it doesn''t meet everyone''s personal definition of fantasy.', '2006-01-23 07:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
