(2076191, 283282, 48224, '<td valign="top">Is that a banyan tree? I love those. <br/> <br/>I like the framing here a lot in fact I really like the overall look of the image with one (fairly major) exception... the blured girl. That is just not working for me. I think I get what you were going for... trying to portray getting a quick fleeting glimpse of a fairy in the forest... however it just looks like a blurry kid in a princess costume.</td>', 'Is that a banyan tree? I love those.  I like the framing here a lot in fact I really like the overall look of the image with one (fairly major) exception... the blured girl. That is just not working for me. I think I get what you were going for... trying to portray getting a quick fleeting glimpse of a fairy in the forest... however it just looks like a blurry kid in a princess costume.', '2006-01-23 22:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2076199, 284552, 6349, '<td valign="top">So much going on here that I enjoy.  First, the composition with the ring of rocks in the front and tree sprouting from the middle with the shadows perfectly sprouting towards me.  Second, the story, or fantasy, if you will, a somewhat vague connection between girl in white dress, flowers, and spotted dog, etc.  Third, the magical processing done to give it that special feeling.  There are a few spots where I feel the blur could have been accomplished better but I understand the difficulties of such a thing.  Overall, one of the top shots in the challenge for sure.  Is this a tribute challenge outtake for Rodney Smith?</td>', 'So much going on here that I enjoy.  First, the composition with the ring of rocks in the front and tree sprouting from the middle with the shadows perfectly sprouting towards me.  Second, the story, or fantasy, if you will, a somewhat vague connection between girl in white dress, flowers, and spotted dog, etc.  Third, the magical processing done to give it that special feeling.  There are a few spots where I feel the blur could have been accomplished better but I understand the difficulties of such a thing.  Overall, one of the top shots in the challenge for sure.  Is this a tribute challenge outtake for Rodney Smith?', '2006-01-23 22:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2076210, 284794, 48224, '<td valign="top">well...I would certainly reconsider watching football if the players looked like that. Overall a good portrait... good composition... and the pink definitely gets your attention...</td>', 'well...I would certainly reconsider watching football if the players looked like that. Overall a good portrait... good composition... and the pink definitely gets your attention...', '2006-01-23 22:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2076294, 284078, 45250, '<td valign="top">I sure hope you got this on the 1st try. A little glare off your fingernail pulls my eyes away from the rest of the photo.</td>', 'I sure hope you got this on the 1st try. A little glare off your fingernail pulls my eyes away from the rest of the photo.', '2006-01-23 22:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
