(2077210, 284594, 10858, '<td valign="top">The blue saber is a bit overexposed, but I like the composition, the expression on the face. I have seen another Jedi photo in this race, it was calm... I love the action here. I tried to cut the blue saber, but the composition needs it, that makes the story a duel. Somehow I would have tried more to avoid the overexposion.</td>', 'The blue saber is a bit overexposed, but I like the composition, the expression on the face. I have seen another Jedi photo in this race, it was calm... I love the action here. I tried to cut the blue saber, but the composition needs it, that makes the story a duel. Somehow I would have tried more to avoid the overexposion.', '2006-01-24 07:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
