(2077880, 284672, 7322, '<td valign="top">I don''t know. This seems like shoehorning to fit the challenge. I think if there were less shadow and more sparkle and light eminating from the snow on the trees this scene would appear more magical. This just doesn''t stand out for me as an extraordinary view of snow.</td>', 'I don''t know. This seems like shoehorning to fit the challenge. I think if there were less shadow and more sparkle and light eminating from the snow on the trees this scene would appear more magical. This just doesn''t stand out for me as an extraordinary view of snow.', '2006-01-24 12:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
