(2078153, 284856, 37252, '<td valign="top">Definitely meets the challenge - good job on that. I think the shadow to the left is a bit harsh, as is the lighting along the right. Perhaps the light was too close to her? The focus seems too soft - but then you are demonstrating kind of a dream, so it works - just not sure it was intentional on your part. Looking at it more, looks like you used NeatImage or some other noise reduction software and hit it too hard, losing the details.</td>', 'Definitely meets the challenge - good job on that. I think the shadow to the left is a bit harsh, as is the lighting along the right. Perhaps the light was too close to her? The focus seems too soft - but then you are demonstrating kind of a dream, so it works - just not sure it was intentional on your part. Looking at it more, looks like you used NeatImage or some other noise reduction software and hit it too hard, losing the details.', '2006-01-24 13:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2078166, 283657, 37252, '<td valign="top">It''s cool how the light looks reflecting on the buddha - would make a neat buddha pic - cropping out the circle lights of course. As for how this turns a fantasy into a photographic reality - not sure, I don''t see what the fantasy is. Maybe if I knew more about buddhism I would - but I''mn just not getting it.</td>', 'It''s cool how the light looks reflecting on the buddha - would make a neat buddha pic - cropping out the circle lights of course. As for how this turns a fantasy into a photographic reality - not sure, I don''t see what the fantasy is. Maybe if I knew more about buddhism I would - but I''mn just not getting it.', '2006-01-24 13:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
