(2079789, 284191, 75713, '<td valign="top">Well done photo... the details of your eyes and the expression on your face are great. I wonder if having the moon (great moon by the way) moved into the upper portion of the photo would be less intrusive and not detract from the man. What I see in this photo is someone who dreams of freefalling.. the jammies I''m not sure about  :)</td>', 'Well done photo... the details of your eyes and the expression on your face are great. I wonder if having the moon (great moon by the way) moved into the upper portion of the photo would be less intrusive and not detract from the man. What I see in this photo is someone who dreams of freefalling.. the jammies I''m not sure about  :)', '2006-01-24 22:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2079805, 284153, 17203, '<td valign="top">You''ve turned an imaginative scene into reality, and you''ve done it very well. The lighting seems a bit harsh, and I suspect you''re gonna get comments about Mr. Kent''s wedding band, but this is one of my top picks. 9</td>', 'You''ve turned an imaginative scene into reality, and you''ve done it very well. The lighting seems a bit harsh, and I suspect you''re gonna get comments about Mr. Kent''s wedding band, but this is one of my top picks. 9', '2006-01-24 22:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2079819, 284616, 75713, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see more texture in the upper portion of this photo (but it might be my crappy monitor) other than that, this is a nice composition - the darkness has depth - a portal?</td>', 'I would have liked to see more texture in the upper portion of this photo (but it might be my crappy monitor) other than that, this is a nice composition - the darkness has depth - a portal?', '2006-01-24 23:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2079824, 284686, 17203, '<td valign="top">Yay! One of the most obvious fantasies in the challenge, rendered in suitably fantastic colors. My only complaint is that the little mermaid is facing out of the scene rather than engaging the viewer or directing attention towards the sun. Still, this is one of the best entries IMO and nails the challenge right betwen the fins. Good job! 9</td>', 'Yay! One of the most obvious fantasies in the challenge, rendered in suitably fantastic colors. My only complaint is that the little mermaid is facing out of the scene rather than engaging the viewer or directing attention towards the sun. Still, this is one of the best entries IMO and nails the challenge right betwen the fins. Good job! 9', '2006-01-24 23:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2079836, 284770, 75713, '<td valign="top">I really like the feeling in this photo.  It evokes, to me, lost childhood and lost dreams...the setting adds to that feeling -  her hair and wings are lovely... wonderfully executed</td>', 'I really like the feeling in this photo.  It evokes, to me, lost childhood and lost dreams...the setting adds to that feeling -  her hair and wings are lovely... wonderfully executed', '2006-01-24 23:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
