(2079905, 284783, 75713, '<td valign="top">I think many would relate to this fantasy......... driving (walking) past a well lit expensive home and dreaming about the people who live in a home like this and might I ever live in a home like this...... it''s almost like an anti-silhouette - I like the way you show color in this overall black photo.</td>', 'I think many would relate to this fantasy......... driving (walking) past a well lit expensive home and dreaming about the people who live in a home like this and might I ever live in a home like this...... it''s almost like an anti-silhouette - I like the way you show color in this overall black photo.', '2006-01-24 23:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
