(2079936, 284239, 75713, '<td valign="top">The lighting is excellent...... her green eyes set off the rest of the B&amp;W image...... the complicated metal shapes on her hand contrasts nicely with the smooth lines of her face.</td>', 'The lighting is excellent...... her green eyes set off the rest of the B&W image...... the complicated metal shapes on her hand contrasts nicely with the smooth lines of her face.', '2006-01-24 23:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
