(2081270, 284858, 48228, '<td valign="top">Wow, he does look surprised.....and a good catch as well.</td>', 'Wow, he does look surprised.....and a good catch as well.', '2006-01-25 03:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2081272, 284785, 48228, '<td valign="top">So sweet, so cute, so adorable, and so good.....</td>', 'So sweet, so cute, so adorable, and so good.....', '2006-01-25 03:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2081279, 284588, 48228, '<td valign="top">Quirky, and very clever.....</td>', 'Quirky, and very clever.....', '2006-01-25 04:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2081357, 284508, 2553, '<td valign="top">Though a bit "mystical" looking, this doesn''t really say "fantasy" to me; the foreground is just too everyday-looking to carry it off.</td>', 'Though a bit "mystical" looking, this doesn''t really say "fantasy" to me; the foreground is just too everyday-looking to carry it off.', '2006-01-25 04:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2081365, 284822, 2553, '<td valign="top">Hmmm..I wouldn''t have called this fantasy, more like nightmare.  I can''t imagine small children fantasizing about growing up so quickly! Nevertheless, an interesting concept, executed fairly well.  I would like to have seen some slight blur or something to give it a more "dreamy" quality.</td>', 'Hmmm..I wouldn''t have called this fantasy, more like nightmare.  I can''t imagine small children fantasizing about growing up so quickly! Nevertheless, an interesting concept, executed fairly well.  I would like to have seen some slight blur or something to give it a more "dreamy" quality.', '2006-01-25 04:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2081368, 284122, 48228, '<td valign="top">I actually like this, the way you have put it together, pleases me.....</td>', 'I actually like this, the way you have put it together, pleases me.....', '2006-01-25 04:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2081376, 284516, 48228, '<td valign="top">Good image here.....</td>', 'Good image here.....', '2006-01-25 04:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2081378, 284833, 48228, '<td valign="top">Cool.....</td>', 'Cool.....', '2006-01-25 04:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2081379, 284140, 2553, '<td valign="top">Not really sure what the title is all about - I''m not a SciFi - so I''m sure that''s why I don''t "get it".  An interesting kind of "concept" shot, nice repeating patterns, composition works OK, but I wouldn''t "get" fantasy from the shot.</td>', 'Not really sure what the title is all about - I''m not a SciFi - so I''m sure that''s why I don''t "get it".  An interesting kind of "concept" shot, nice repeating patterns, composition works OK, but I wouldn''t "get" fantasy from the shot.', '2006-01-25 04:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2081387, 284783, 48228, '<td valign="top">This is such a fine image, and it does give one the feeling of something quite special about this mystical house. Really good shot as well.....</td>', 'This is such a fine image, and it does give one the feeling of something quite special about this mystical house. Really good shot as well.....', '2006-01-25 04:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2081389, 284603, 2553, '<td valign="top">Nice, crisp, clear shot; I like the slight vignette.  This wouldn''t be my idea of fantasy, but definitely an "otherwordly" looking landscape. Composition works well in leading my eye throughout the image, and I really like the clarity of the shot - it looks almost crystalline.</td>', 'Nice, crisp, clear shot; I like the slight vignette.  This wouldn''t be my idea of fantasy, but definitely an "otherwordly" looking landscape. Composition works well in leading my eye throughout the image, and I really like the clarity of the shot - it looks almost crystalline.', '2006-01-25 04:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2081391, 283631, 48228, '<td valign="top">The cloud formation is just perfect..... I like how you have taken this image, well done.....</td>', 'The cloud formation is just perfect..... I like how you have taken this image, well done.....', '2006-01-25 04:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2081396, 284798, 48228, '<td valign="top">This would have to be everyones dream, even me..... Nice work.</td>', 'This would have to be everyones dream, even me..... Nice work.', '2006-01-25 04:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2081398, 284822, 48228, '<td valign="top">This is good, very good, well done.....It made me laugh.....</td>', 'This is good, very good, well done.....It made me laugh.....', '2006-01-25 04:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2081400, 284190, 48228, '<td valign="top">Starting young, it is so good to believe..... Nice work</td>', 'Starting young, it is so good to believe..... Nice work', '2006-01-25 04:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2081403, 284794, 48228, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait that you have taken, well done.....She could be on everybody''s team.......</td>', 'Lovely portrait that you have taken, well done.....She could be on everybody''s team.......', '2006-01-25 04:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2081408, 282241, 48228, '<td valign="top">"WoW", "WoW", "WoW'' lost in space, this is just brilliant..... Should ribbon for sure..... Not my cup of tea, but so very well done.....EXCELLENT........ <br/>Every time I see this image it gets better, and better.....I am giving you a ten.</td>', '"WoW", "WoW", "WoW'' lost in space, this is just brilliant..... Should ribbon for sure..... Not my cup of tea, but so very well done.....EXCELLENT........ Every time I see this image it gets better, and better.....I am giving you a ten.', '2006-01-25 04:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2081410, 284603, 48228, '<td valign="top">This is what I have been dreaming about, just magical, and a true fantasy. <br/>I personally love it, and yes, it does have the "WOW" factor as well..... You have taken a simple landscape and made it a fantasy, in my eyes..... <br/>This will definately be going into "my favorites", when the challenge closes, and the winners are announced.....</td>', 'This is what I have been dreaming about, just magical, and a true fantasy. I personally love it, and yes, it does have the "WOW" factor as well..... You have taken a simple landscape and made it a fantasy, in my eyes..... This will definately be going into "my favorites", when the challenge closes, and the winners are announced.....', '2006-01-25 04:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2081419, 284698, 2553, '<td valign="top">A nice, crisp, well-lit image.  Without the title,though,I wouldn''t have thought "Fantasy".  The title made me stop and think about it, and invest a little imagination in the image.  I can certainly see the concept, the image doesn''t fully carry off the "fantasy" part for me.</td>', 'A nice, crisp, well-lit image.  Without the title,though,I wouldn''t have thought "Fantasy".  The title made me stop and think about it, and invest a little imagination in the image.  I can certainly see the concept, the image doesn''t fully carry off the "fantasy" part for me.', '2006-01-25 05:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2081429, 284441, 2553, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but nothing about this image says "Fantasy" to me.  I know we all have different visions of what fantasy is, but this doesn''t really say fantasy, to me, in any form.  I think I understand the concept of "fantasizing" about your boss being some kind of weird bird, but fantasizing, and <i>fantasy</i>, seem very different.</td>', 'Sorry, but nothing about this image says "Fantasy" to me.  I know we all have different visions of what fantasy is, but this doesn''t really say fantasy, to me, in any form.  I think I understand the concept of "fantasizing" about your boss being some kind of weird bird, but fantasizing, and fantasy, seem very different.', '2006-01-25 05:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2081459, 283282, 2553, '<td valign="top">Finally! An image that really says "Fantasy".  I was beginning to wonder if I was really voting in the "Fantasy" challenge.<br/> <br/>I really like this, would have liked to have seen a slight dreamy blur applied to the whole image - the starkness of the foreground trees detracts slightly for me, nevertheless, the trees are a very intriguing element in the shot, and I love the sharp angle of the large tree - it creates unexpected visual interest.  Very cool.</td>', 'Finally! An image that really says "Fantasy".  I was beginning to wonder if I was really voting in the "Fantasy" challenge. I really like this, would have liked to have seen a slight dreamy blur applied to the whole image - the starkness of the foreground trees detracts slightly for me, nevertheless, the trees are a very intriguing element in the shot, and I love the sharp angle of the large tree - it creates unexpected visual interest.  Very cool.', '2006-01-25 05:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2081462, 284858, 2553, '<td valign="top">For the comedy aspect of Fantasy, you definitely get my vote. This did make me laugh, and I can well imagine that it is more than one person''s fantasy!</td>', 'For the comedy aspect of Fantasy, you definitely get my vote. This did make me laugh, and I can well imagine that it is more than one person''s fantasy!', '2006-01-25 05:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2081471, 284552, 2553, '<td valign="top">Honestly, I would have given this a 10 if the dog and the statue weren''t there, and she was actually swinging. It has elements that definitely give it a fantasy feel, but stops just short of fully carrying it off for me.  9</td>', 'Honestly, I would have given this a 10 if the dog and the statue weren''t there, and she was actually swinging. It has elements that definitely give it a fantasy feel, but stops just short of fully carrying it off for me.  9', '2006-01-25 05:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2081483, 284122, 2553, '<td valign="top">My intial reaction: If those tiny red things weren''t there, this would totally work for me.  I''m not at all sure why, but this has very strong appeal for me, other than being distracted by the red windsock or whatever it is. It has a very powerful, otherworldly feel to it that surprises me somewhat.</td>', 'My intial reaction: If those tiny red things weren''t there, this would totally work for me.  I''m not at all sure why, but this has very strong appeal for me, other than being distracted by the red windsock or whatever it is. It has a very powerful, otherworldly feel to it that surprises me somewhat.', '2006-01-25 05:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2081488, 284784, 48228, '<td valign="top">Very delicate, and quite pleasing to the eye.....</td>', 'Very delicate, and quite pleasing to the eye.....', '2006-01-25 05:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
