(2083488, 284686, 47117, '<td valign="top">Very cool, but it would had been better if she was facing the opposite way. It would give a viewers perspective a bit more of an opportunity to imagine she was looking at something. I was always taught in photography that if your subject, such as one looking, is going to be offset, make sure they are looking into the depth of the photo, and not the outer edge.  Just thought I might share that, but nice shot.</td>', 'Very cool, but it would had been better if she was facing the opposite way. It would give a viewers perspective a bit more of an opportunity to imagine she was looking at something. I was always taught in photography that if your subject, such as one looking, is going to be offset, make sure they are looking into the depth of the photo, and not the outer edge.  Just thought I might share that, but nice shot.', '2006-01-25 15:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
