(2085038, 284583, 22734, '<td valign="top">No shot like it in DPC. This is not just technique but done with superb good taste to awaken the magic of the carpet ride that resides in us all. If there did not exist a current voting irregularity I would venture to say that this image may score a very high place and one that will find its way into the favorites of many viewers. A strong milestone of achievement.</td>', 'No shot like it in DPC. This is not just technique but done with superb good taste to awaken the magic of the carpet ride that resides in us all. If there did not exist a current voting irregularity I would venture to say that this image may score a very high place and one that will find its way into the favorites of many viewers. A strong milestone of achievement.', '2006-01-25 22:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
