(2085206, 282241, 37893, '<td valign="top">Dude! This thing gives me the creeps! I LOVE IT! On to my faves and if this image doesn''t break top 10, I''ll break out the bionic bat!<br/> <br/>Very nicely done! I love the seemless overlap in this double exposure ;) 10</td>', 'Dude! This thing gives me the creeps! I LOVE IT! On to my faves and if this image doesn''t break top 10, I''ll break out the bionic bat! Very nicely done! I love the seemless overlap in this double exposure ;) 10', '2006-01-25 22:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
