(2085255, 284663, 30310, '<td valign="top">yes!!! YESSS!!!! YES!!! AMAZING!!! <b>&lt;33333333333</b></td>', 'yes!!! YESSS!!!! YES!!! AMAZING!!! <33333333333', '2006-01-25 22:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085334, 284785, 10261, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the lighting here. The wings border on overexposed in some places, while the baby''s face is underexposed. The look on the kid''s face is great. Adding a stronger catchlight would really help to bring out her eyes.</td>', 'I don''t care for the lighting here. The wings border on overexposed in some places, while the baby''s face is underexposed. The look on the kid''s face is great. Adding a stronger catchlight would really help to bring out her eyes.', '2006-01-25 23:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085341, 284753, 37893, '<td valign="top">Very JPR feel to this image. Love it. Great double exposures here.</td>', 'Very JPR feel to this image. Love it. Great double exposures here.', '2006-01-25 23:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085347, 283282, 37893, '<td valign="top">This has such a nice feel to it. Almost fairy tale like ;) Great!</td>', 'This has such a nice feel to it. Almost fairy tale like ;) Great!', '2006-01-25 23:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085348, 284784, 10261, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, but it''s association with the challenge topic is unclear.</td>', 'I like the shot, but it''s association with the challenge topic is unclear.', '2006-01-25 23:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085358, 282929, 10261, '<td valign="top">Good concept. The illusion would have been better if the flames lined up better with the fingertips. All of the jewelry on the model is distracting.</td>', 'Good concept. The illusion would have been better if the flames lined up better with the fingertips. All of the jewelry on the model is distracting.', '2006-01-25 23:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085370, 282241, 12268, '<td valign="top">very interesting shot. usually the neatimage overdose is a certain low scorer but here it is very well used, adding that needed waxy look. I like the extra sharp focus of the eye as well as the look &amp; feel of it. Really fantastic shot. A sure ribbon winner. 10, Good luck!</td>', 'very interesting shot. usually the neatimage overdose is a certain low scorer but here it is very well used, adding that needed waxy look. I like the extra sharp focus of the eye as well as the look & feel of it. Really fantastic shot. A sure ribbon winner. 10, Good luck!', '2006-01-25 23:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085378, 284603, 37893, '<td valign="top">Wow! Very nicely done. The purple actually lends a surreal appearance to this image. Great job! Great IR!</td>', 'Wow! Very nicely done. The purple actually lends a surreal appearance to this image. Great job! Great IR!', '2006-01-25 23:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085382, 284794, 37893, '<td valign="top">Yowsa! Sorry I''m just a bit speechless right now. Let me recompose ;)</td>', 'Yowsa! Sorry I''m just a bit speechless right now. Let me recompose ;)', '2006-01-25 23:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085385, 284667, 10261, '<td valign="top">Having the smoke go over the bottom of the border is a nice touch.</td>', 'Having the smoke go over the bottom of the border is a nice touch.', '2006-01-25 23:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085388, 284866, 37893, '<td valign="top">Marac? Is this you? The focus seems a bit soft and slightly off.</td>', 'Marac? Is this you? The focus seems a bit soft and slightly off.', '2006-01-25 23:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085391, 283631, 37893, '<td valign="top">I love the expression this image conveys. Lovely skies too!</td>', 'I love the expression this image conveys. Lovely skies too!', '2006-01-25 23:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085393, 284552, 50531, '<td valign="top">Great set up and looks so Natural great work 8 from me</td>', 'Great set up and looks so Natural great work 8 from me', '2006-01-25 23:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085399, 284671, 10261, '<td valign="top">This is so over processed that it looks fake. While an air of surreality may be the intent, since this is a photography contest rather than a digital art contest it would be nice to have the image look plausible.</td>', 'This is so over processed that it looks fake. While an air of surreality may be the intent, since this is a photography contest rather than a digital art contest it would be nice to have the image look plausible.', '2006-01-25 23:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085400, 284785, 37893, '<td valign="top">Sooo cute! The focus is soft but it works for this image.</td>', 'Sooo cute! The focus is soft but it works for this image.', '2006-01-25 23:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085404, 284543, 37893, '<td valign="top">Lovely silhouette.</td>', 'Lovely silhouette.', '2006-01-25 23:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085407, 283112, 37893, '<td valign="top">Love this image. The red draws your attention immediately to the subject ;) Great job!</td>', 'Love this image. The red draws your attention immediately to the subject ;) Great job!', '2006-01-25 23:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085408, 284190, 10261, '<td valign="top">This looks like a snapshot (albeit a good one) that was forced into the challenge topic</td>', 'This looks like a snapshot (albeit a good one) that was forced into the challenge topic', '2006-01-25 23:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085413, 284770, 37893, '<td valign="top">Hello Annah! I love the simplicity and starkness of your photos. I''m not quite certain about the "tilt" of the "horizon" but I love the burst of color from your wig. The "wings" are a nice compliment as well.</td>', 'Hello Annah! I love the simplicity and starkness of your photos. I''m not quite certain about the "tilt" of the "horizon" but I love the burst of color from your wig. The "wings" are a nice compliment as well.', '2006-01-25 23:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085414, 284762, 10261, '<td valign="top">This looks like a snapshot. The title feels like a halfhearted attempt at making this meet the challenge topic.</td>', 'This looks like a snapshot. The title feels like a halfhearted attempt at making this meet the challenge topic.', '2006-01-25 23:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085418, 284817, 37893, '<td valign="top">Hehehe. I''m glad you''re experimenting with this technique. It served me well before and I hope yours does as well.</td>', 'Hehehe. I''m glad you''re experimenting with this technique. It served me well before and I hope yours does as well.', '2006-01-25 23:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085431, 283499, 37893, '<td valign="top">You know, there''s something about this image that strikes me. The grain works believe it or not. I can''t place my finger on it but I like this image. It''s the color and something else....</td>', 'You know, there''s something about this image that strikes me. The grain works believe it or not. I can''t place my finger on it but I like this image. It''s the color and something else....', '2006-01-25 23:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085435, 284821, 37893, '<td valign="top">Wonderful work. Reminds me of Labuda''s work. Nice double exposure. I like the softness at the edges. Great work.</td>', 'Wonderful work. Reminds me of Labuda''s work. Nice double exposure. I like the softness at the edges. Great work.', '2006-01-25 23:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085438, 282220, 10261, '<td valign="top">Cropping part way through her pupil gives this image unnecessary visual tension. If your goal was to include all of her lips and only a fraction of the rest of her face, cropping at an angle (e.g. from just above the inside of her eyebrow, across the bridge of her nose, and down her cheek) would have probably been more interesting. A little more breathing room below her lips would have been nice. The catchlight does a good job of highlighting her eye. I think that a less frowny expression would have made this a more pleasing picture.</td>', 'Cropping part way through her pupil gives this image unnecessary visual tension. If your goal was to include all of her lips and only a fraction of the rest of her face, cropping at an angle (e.g. from just above the inside of her eyebrow, across the bridge of her nose, and down her cheek) would have probably been more interesting. A little more breathing room below her lips would have been nice. The catchlight does a good job of highlighting her eye. I think that a less frowny expression would have made this a more pleasing picture.', '2006-01-25 23:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085442, 284760, 37893, '<td valign="top">Lovely lovely lovely! I like the use of the mirror and the rotation. Great effect of surreality.</td>', 'Lovely lovely lovely! I like the use of the mirror and the rotation. Great effect of surreality.', '2006-01-25 23:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085448, 284854, 37893, '<td valign="top">This looks like a digital model. Hmmmm.... I look at the floor and it''s fake but wow! What a lovely car ;)</td>', 'This looks like a digital model. Hmmmm.... I look at the floor and it''s fake but wow! What a lovely car ;)', '2006-01-25 23:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085465, 284779, 10261, '<td valign="top">Don''t you mean "Burgeoning" rather than "Bludgeoning"? Your title might make sense if the picture contained water violently smashing against rocks, but this looks rather calm and pensive.<br/> <br/>The contrast is nice, and the color cast adds a nice feeling of atmosphere. If you''d have dodged &amp; burned the sky and waves a little more this could have been even moodier. I''d prefer to see the horizon a little farther from the center of the frame. The land jutting into the left edge of the frame does a good job of grounding the shot and giving it a sense of scale. The harsh vignetting on the top corners are a little distracting; if the effect was more subtle I think that it would improve the the image.</td>', 'Don''t you mean "Burgeoning" rather than "Bludgeoning"? Your title might make sense if the picture contained water violently smashing against rocks, but this looks rather calm and pensive. The contrast is nice, and the color cast adds a nice feeling of atmosphere. If you''d have dodged & burned the sky and waves a little more this could have been even moodier. I''d prefer to see the horizon a little farther from the center of the frame. The land jutting into the left edge of the frame does a good job of grounding the shot and giving it a sense of scale. The harsh vignetting on the top corners are a little distracting; if the effect was more subtle I think that it would improve the the image.', '2006-01-25 23:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085479, 284794, 52058, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, great colors &amp; lighting, beautiful model. "Nice work !</td>', 'Nice shot, great colors & lighting, beautiful model. "Nice work !', '2006-01-25 23:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085482, 284840, 10261, '<td valign="top">This looks a little too staged and self-conscious to work. The bright lighting contrasts with the somewhat dark thematic elements, and the composition doesn''t use that contrast to it''s advantage. The well-manicured nails and the fact that the model''s hand is holding the restraint rather than being held by it seems to work against the intended theme as well. This ironic contrast between the various thematic elements could be made to work in your favor, but somehow it seems too accidental to work here.</td>', 'This looks a little too staged and self-conscious to work. The bright lighting contrasts with the somewhat dark thematic elements, and the composition doesn''t use that contrast to it''s advantage. The well-manicured nails and the fact that the model''s hand is holding the restraint rather than being held by it seems to work against the intended theme as well. This ironic contrast between the various thematic elements could be made to work in your favor, but somehow it seems too accidental to work here.', '2006-01-25 23:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085552, 284141, 10261, '<td valign="top">The relationship to the challenge is difficult to discern. The picture seems to be of nothing in particular, and is out of focus.</td>', 'The relationship to the challenge is difficult to discern. The picture seems to be of nothing in particular, and is out of focus.', '2006-01-25 23:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085556, 284153, 10261, '<td valign="top">The odd, warm color cast is distracting, and the superman background looks very flat.</td>', 'The odd, warm color cast is distracting, and the superman background looks very flat.', '2006-01-25 23:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085559, 284588, 10261, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t seem to relate to the challenge topic.</td>', 'This doesn''t seem to relate to the challenge topic.', '2006-01-25 23:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085564, 284783, 10261, '<td valign="top">The uneven horizon is distracting. I can''t tell what the poorly-lit house has to do with the topic.</td>', 'The uneven horizon is distracting. I can''t tell what the poorly-lit house has to do with the topic.', '2006-01-25 23:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085595, 284622, 10261, '<td valign="top">You have a beautiful model; why did you make her look plastic with the aggressive NeatImage-ing? I think that doing so really hurt an otherwise great photo. A stronger catchlight would have made this a stronger portrait. I''d be interested in seeing more texture detail in her clothing; I''m not sure how much of this lack of texture is due to the lighting configuration and how much was just killed by NI.</td>', 'You have a beautiful model; why did you make her look plastic with the aggressive NeatImage-ing? I think that doing so really hurt an otherwise great photo. A stronger catchlight would have made this a stronger portrait. I''d be interested in seeing more texture detail in her clothing; I''m not sure how much of this lack of texture is due to the lighting configuration and how much was just killed by NI.', '2006-01-26 00:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085620, 284721, 10261, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but the execution is lacking. The projection on the shirt looks fairly good, but on the face it just looks odd. Adding another element to complement the illusion (e.g. a torn cheek with circuitry visible under the skin) would have dramatically helped this photograph. The lighting looks rather flat. While this may have been necessary due to the technique that you used, increasing the contrast in your image editing software would have given this image a lot of additional depth.</td>', 'I like the concept, but the execution is lacking. The projection on the shirt looks fairly good, but on the face it just looks odd. Adding another element to complement the illusion (e.g. a torn cheek with circuitry visible under the skin) would have dramatically helped this photograph. The lighting looks rather flat. While this may have been necessary due to the technique that you used, increasing the contrast in your image editing software would have given this image a lot of additional depth.', '2006-01-26 00:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085626, 284563, 10261, '<td valign="top">This is a great, stock-like image, but it seems like an unduly concrete interpretation of the challenge topic.</td>', 'This is a great, stock-like image, but it seems like an unduly concrete interpretation of the challenge topic.', '2006-01-26 00:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085643, 284809, 49867, '<td valign="top">Really well done. I really like this one.</td>', 'Really well done. I really like this one.', '2006-01-26 00:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085644, 284610, 10261, '<td valign="top">This looks over-sharpened. Adding a human element to this photo would give it a big kick. As it is, it just looks like a well-done  architectural photograph. Placing a person, a glass slipper, etc. on the stairs would add an emotional dimension to the image, which I think would improve the picture considerably.</td>', 'This looks over-sharpened. Adding a human element to this photo would give it a big kick. As it is, it just looks like a well-done  architectural photograph. Placing a person, a glass slipper, etc. on the stairs would add an emotional dimension to the image, which I think would improve the picture considerably.', '2006-01-26 00:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085645, 282627, 49867, '<td valign="top">EXCELLENT!!!!</td>', 'EXCELLENT!!!!', '2006-01-26 00:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085656, 284672, 10261, '<td valign="top">The colors in this image are rather drab and the lighting rather flat. Both of these could have been corrected in your image editor by altering the contrast and color saturation. I think that the composition would be stronger if there was a clear point of interest for me to look at; as it is it just looks like any other stand of trees.</td>', 'The colors in this image are rather drab and the lighting rather flat. Both of these could have been corrected in your image editor by altering the contrast and color saturation. I think that the composition would be stronger if there was a clear point of interest for me to look at; as it is it just looks like any other stand of trees.', '2006-01-26 00:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085660, 284131, 49867, '<td valign="top">Sorry buddy, witty idea but i don''t see any artisitic value!!!!!<br/>BU HAO!!!</td>', 'Sorry buddy, witty idea but i don''t see any artisitic value!!!!!BU HAO!!!', '2006-01-26 00:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085667, 284856, 10261, '<td valign="top">The angle of the light casts odd shadows on the model''s right arm, highlighting wrinkles and making her look rather old. There''s an odd blueish color cast on her arm that I find a bit distracting. Her chest, neck and chin have far too little texture - go easy on the NeatImage &amp;/or airbrushing. The light is a little harsh; the white suit is overexposed on the bottom right and almost blends in with the background, while the side away from the light is awash in deep, harsh shadows. Moving your light farther from the model, moving her a bit farther from the background, and possibly adding another, dimmer light from the other side would help to correct this.</td>', 'The angle of the light casts odd shadows on the model''s right arm, highlighting wrinkles and making her look rather old. There''s an odd blueish color cast on her arm that I find a bit distracting. Her chest, neck and chin have far too little texture - go easy on the NeatImage &/or airbrushing. The light is a little harsh; the white suit is overexposed on the bottom right and almost blends in with the background, while the side away from the light is awash in deep, harsh shadows. Moving your light farther from the model, moving her a bit farther from the background, and possibly adding another, dimmer light from the other side would help to correct this.', '2006-01-26 00:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085670, 284753, 10261, '<td valign="top">Nice, subtle multiple exposure.</td>', 'Nice, subtle multiple exposure.', '2006-01-26 00:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085671, 284628, 49867, '<td valign="top">The quality of the original photo isn''t good enough. Its not a bad picture, just not contest material.</td>', 'The quality of the original photo isn''t good enough. Its not a bad picture, just not contest material.', '2006-01-26 00:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085677, 284541, 49867, '<td valign="top">Thats a nice photo.</td>', 'Thats a nice photo.', '2006-01-26 00:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085680, 284153, 49867, '<td valign="top">Super man wore a ring???</td>', 'Super man wore a ring???', '2006-01-26 00:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085684, 284686, 10261, '<td valign="top">This looks too fake and digital-artsy to appeal to me in a photography contest. I think that in this context the fantasy would feel more fantastic if it were better grounded in something that looked real. I think that I''d be able to connect better with an element of fantasy that''s surrounded by the everyday mundanity than one which is surrounded by an artificial looking scene.</td>', 'This looks too fake and digital-artsy to appeal to me in a photography contest. I think that in this context the fantasy would feel more fantastic if it were better grounded in something that looked real. I think that I''d be able to connect better with an element of fantasy that''s surrounded by the everyday mundanity than one which is surrounded by an artificial looking scene.', '2006-01-26 00:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085687, 283499, 20462, '<td valign="top">is that a club? or a bizarre cow?  no, you are right, leaving that one alone</td>', 'is that a club? or a bizarre cow?  no, you are right, leaving that one alone', '2006-01-26 00:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085690, 283499, 10261, '<td valign="top">It''s be nice if you were either more abstract or more concrete with the content of the photo; as presented here it''s not enticing enough to make me look any deeper.</td>', 'It''s be nice if you were either more abstract or more concrete with the content of the photo; as presented here it''s not enticing enough to make me look any deeper.', '2006-01-26 00:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085691, 284733, 20462, '<td valign="top">this is just surreal.  If this is your fantasy, then you are truly unique.</td>', 'this is just surreal.  If this is your fantasy, then you are truly unique.', '2006-01-26 00:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085696, 284656, 20462, '<td valign="top">"too soft".  if that is a criticism, I must thank my neurologist.  no it is just weird actually.</td>', '"too soft".  if that is a criticism, I must thank my neurologist.  no it is just weird actually.', '2006-01-26 00:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085700, 284854, 20462, '<td valign="top">oh, now that is sweet.  The vignetting aroundt he courners is a little harsh and obvious, but it doesn''t distract from the beauty of this fantasy.</td>', 'oh, now that is sweet.  The vignetting aroundt he courners is a little harsh and obvious, but it doesn''t distract from the beauty of this fantasy.', '2006-01-26 00:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085704, 284147, 20462, '<td valign="top">works for me.  fantasy = dream.  got it.</td>', 'works for me.  fantasy = dream.  got it.', '2006-01-26 00:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085706, 284865, 20462, '<td valign="top">a psychedelic jellyfish.  trust me, you are seeing the world differently.</td>', 'a psychedelic jellyfish.  trust me, you are seeing the world differently.', '2006-01-26 00:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085709, 284583, 10261, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea, but the lighting is too far off to make this illusion work. I think that even placing the magic carpet on a table to raise it up from the background would help you to pull off the illusion.</td>', 'I really like the idea, but the lighting is too far off to make this illusion work. I think that even placing the magic carpet on a table to raise it up from the background would help you to pull off the illusion.', '2006-01-26 00:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085710, 284131, 20462, '<td valign="top">jackpot!  just how many millions is in a mega?</td>', 'jackpot!  just how many millions is in a mega?', '2006-01-26 00:26:47.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2085713, 283585, 20462, '<td valign="top">is the left turn symbolic?  mini''s are pretty cool, and I see your reflection.</td>', 'is the left turn symbolic?  mini''s are pretty cool, and I see your reflection.', '2006-01-26 00:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085716, 284798, 20462, '<td valign="top">that is one of my dreams too.  Too bad you can''t see more of it.  this is more of sunset/seascape picture than an island picture</td>', 'that is one of my dreams too.  Too bad you can''t see more of it.  this is more of sunset/seascape picture than an island picture', '2006-01-26 00:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085722, 284822, 20462, '<td valign="top">works.  now is this the kid''s fantasy or the adult''s?  works either way, just a thought to consider</td>', 'works.  now is this the kid''s fantasy or the adult''s?  works either way, just a thought to consider', '2006-01-26 00:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085727, 284593, 20462, '<td valign="top">way processed for artistic value. doesn''t bother me, will bother others.</td>', 'way processed for artistic value. doesn''t bother me, will bother others.', '2006-01-26 00:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085728, 284846, 10261, '<td valign="top">The color cast is somewhat distracting - it''s too white to feel like a faded or antique  photo, and too far off white to feel properly white balanced. I like the concept, but the flowers and the stool make this feel a lot cheesier than it would if it were taken with a shallow DoF outside with a blurry environmental scene as the backdrop.</td>', 'The color cast is somewhat distracting - it''s too white to feel like a faded or antique  photo, and too far off white to feel properly white balanced. I like the concept, but the flowers and the stool make this feel a lot cheesier than it would if it were taken with a shallow DoF outside with a blurry environmental scene as the backdrop.', '2006-01-26 00:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085735, 284615, 10261, '<td valign="top">The strong shadows are distracting. Moving your model farther from the backdrop would have helped to reduce the impact of the photos on the final image.</td>', 'The strong shadows are distracting. Moving your model farther from the backdrop would have helped to reduce the impact of the photos on the final image.', '2006-01-26 00:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085738, 282241, 20462, '<td valign="top">the skin and eye of the human component of the cyborg are actually more interesting than the robotic side.  is this your fantasy though?  indestructible aspect is cool, but the red eye will scare away the fairer sex.  well done all the way around.</td>', 'the skin and eye of the human component of the cyborg are actually more interesting than the robotic side.  is this your fantasy though?  indestructible aspect is cool, but the red eye will scare away the fairer sex.  well done all the way around.', '2006-01-26 00:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085740, 283632, 20462, '<td valign="top">is this a fantasy?  the cool thing about this challenge is that it forces you to see other fantasies and accept them.  can''t really argue with this challenge..  background is actually cooler than the overexposed subject.  but brave attempt.</td>', 'is this a fantasy?  the cool thing about this challenge is that it forces you to see other fantasies and accept them.  can''t really argue with this challenge..  background is actually cooler than the overexposed subject.  but brave attempt.', '2006-01-26 00:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
