(2085744, 284628, 20462, '<td valign="top">congrats on the validation.  that is all i can say</td>', 'congrats on the validation.  that is all i can say', '2006-01-26 00:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085748, 284535, 10261, '<td valign="top">The vignetting and shadowed eye sockets are distracting. Placing something light colored just below the camera would help to bounce light back onto his face, which would help the latter problem. The image would be more appealing if it weren''t so heavily sharpened. The relationship of the image to the challenge topic feels rather forced.</td>', 'The vignetting and shadowed eye sockets are distracting. Placing something light colored just below the camera would help to bounce light back onto his face, which would help the latter problem. The image would be more appealing if it weren''t so heavily sharpened. The relationship of the image to the challenge topic feels rather forced.', '2006-01-26 00:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085750, 284753, 20462, '<td valign="top">uh oh.  i think this is just bizarre and fantastic.  anyway, i think this attempt is beyond my understanding of delivery.  my style and drive is so utterly different than yours, i find myself intrigued.  but really for only your sake.  the image has lasting power.</td>', 'uh oh.  i think this is just bizarre and fantastic.  anyway, i think this attempt is beyond my understanding of delivery.  my style and drive is so utterly different than yours, i find myself intrigued.  but really for only your sake.  the image has lasting power.', '2006-01-26 00:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085751, 283282, 20462, '<td valign="top">i hope people don''t get pissed off at you for the blurred girl.  Because that enhances the idea, story and execution of this obvious gem.  top marks from me.  please ribbon.</td>', 'i hope people don''t get pissed off at you for the blurred girl.  Because that enhances the idea, story and execution of this obvious gem.  top marks from me.  please ribbon.', '2006-01-26 00:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085755, 284508, 20462, '<td valign="top">makes me feel enchanted things are going on in this world.  i just wish the processing highlighted this idea better</td>', 'makes me feel enchanted things are going on in this world.  i just wish the processing highlighted this idea better', '2006-01-26 00:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085756, 283868, 10261, '<td valign="top">The FedEx box in the background seems like a needless distraction. I think that the fantasy you''ve depicted will resonate with virtually everyone, but the execution is rather unremarkable. Changing the angle, light, etc could have produced a better image.</td>', 'The FedEx box in the background seems like a needless distraction. I think that the fantasy you''ve depicted will resonate with virtually everyone, but the execution is rather unremarkable. Changing the angle, light, etc could have produced a better image.', '2006-01-26 00:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085757, 283585, 10261, '<td valign="top">How does this relate to the challenge topic?</td>', 'How does this relate to the challenge topic?', '2006-01-26 00:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085759, 282913, 10261, '<td valign="top">The very low contrast makes your image rather flat; without a clear subject (e.g. a figure in the trees) this image doesn''t seem to have much to look at.</td>', 'The very low contrast makes your image rather flat; without a clear subject (e.g. a figure in the trees) this image doesn''t seem to have much to look at.', '2006-01-26 00:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085765, 283712, 10261, '<td valign="top">I realize that it''s winter in the northern hemisphere, but this would have been a lot more appealing if the grass were green. It might take a few passes, but I suspect that you could shift the hue of the grass to make it appear to be a healthy summer green.</td>', 'I realize that it''s winter in the northern hemisphere, but this would have been a lot more appealing if the grass were green. It might take a few passes, but I suspect that you could shift the hue of the grass to make it appear to be a healthy summer green.', '2006-01-26 00:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085768, 284628, 10261, '<td valign="top">This seems more novel than genuinely interesting. I think that you could have found a more interesting subject to shoot with this filter.</td>', 'This seems more novel than genuinely interesting. I think that you could have found a more interesting subject to shoot with this filter.', '2006-01-26 00:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085769, 283112, 10261, '<td valign="top">The light makes the guy &amp; umbrella look flat and artificial. The footsteps and misty horizon are a nice touch.</td>', 'The light makes the guy & umbrella look flat and artificial. The footsteps and misty horizon are a nice touch.', '2006-01-26 00:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085772, 282766, 10261, '<td valign="top">This looks like a relatively poor snapshot of a family pet that was titled to contort it toward the challenge topic.</td>', 'This looks like a relatively poor snapshot of a family pet that was titled to contort it toward the challenge topic.', '2006-01-26 00:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085775, 284651, 10261, '<td valign="top">The relationship to the challenge topic is severely understated, and the bilk of the image is dedicated to uninteresting visual noise. Is this guy trying to find Chit''s rake?</td>', 'The relationship to the challenge topic is severely understated, and the bilk of the image is dedicated to uninteresting visual noise. Is this guy trying to find Chit''s rake?', '2006-01-26 00:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085780, 284122, 10261, '<td valign="top">If not for the red light I wouldn''t have noticed that this is a long exposure of a skyline. Nice idea, but without the title it doesn''t seem to relate very strongly to the challenge topic.</td>', 'If not for the red light I wouldn''t have noticed that this is a long exposure of a skyline. Nice idea, but without the title it doesn''t seem to relate very strongly to the challenge topic.', '2006-01-26 00:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085784, 283973, 10261, '<td valign="top">This looks more like composite line art than photography. Since this is a photography challenge I''d like this better if the composition emphasized the photography rather than the drawing.</td>', 'This looks more like composite line art than photography. Since this is a photography challenge I''d like this better if the composition emphasized the photography rather than the drawing.', '2006-01-26 00:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085793, 283632, 10261, '<td valign="top">This looks like one of librodo''s shots. The symbolic connotations of the girl''s pose really add a lot to this already strong image. The texture of the lace and wings make the image look slightly over-sharpened. The high-key lighting has washed out a lot of the tonal detail on her face (the symbolic differences between the lighting techniques would have been interesting too; making the light fade from light on one side to dark on the other would have been interesting as well, regardless of which side was lighter). Personally I''d have rather seen a lower-key version with more detail in her face. The lighting is a touch flatter than I''d like. Having said that, this is still my top pick for the ribbon in this challenge. Nicely done.</td>', 'This looks like one of librodo''s shots. The symbolic connotations of the girl''s pose really add a lot to this already strong image. The texture of the lace and wings make the image look slightly over-sharpened. The high-key lighting has washed out a lot of the tonal detail on her face (the symbolic differences between the lighting techniques would have been interesting too; making the light fade from light on one side to dark on the other would have been interesting as well, regardless of which side was lighter). Personally I''d have rather seen a lower-key version with more detail in her face. The lighting is a touch flatter than I''d like. Having said that, this is still my top pick for the ribbon in this challenge. Nicely done.', '2006-01-26 01:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085942, 284603, 37320, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, this shot is what the challenge is about.</td>', 'Gorgeous, this shot is what the challenge is about.', '2006-01-26 02:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
