(2089946, 284677, 22734, '<td valign="top">I can see where you are going here. I would have explored including the entire right hand or simply a repositioning. The image is good and it does portray the fantasy as the peak of expression is on the model''s face, but then the eyes have to negotiate the light and shadows which come under more scrutiny because of the oil. All in all, you get high marks because the image does convey its meaning. 7</td>', 'I can see where you are going here. I would have explored including the entire right hand or simply a repositioning. The image is good and it does portray the fantasy as the peak of expression is on the model''s face, but then the eyes have to negotiate the light and shadows which come under more scrutiny because of the oil. All in all, you get high marks because the image does convey its meaning. 7', '2006-01-26 21:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
