(2089973, 284508, 48717, '<td valign="top">This has the posibility of being a really nice image.  It is a creative fit to the challenge, but the sky seems flat and all of the green grass in front draws the eye away from what your true subject is.  I would suggest cropping out a bit of the grass and then upping the contrast and blue saturation in the sky.</td>', 'This has the posibility of being a really nice image.  It is a creative fit to the challenge, but the sky seems flat and all of the green grass in front draws the eye away from what your true subject is.  I would suggest cropping out a bit of the grass and then upping the contrast and blue saturation in the sky.', '2006-01-26 21:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
