(2089984, 282913, 48717, '<td valign="top">Good try, I know this picture could be improved, I am just not sure how to tell you to do it.  It seems like you lightened on the computer it to compensate for underexposure in the camera, and that was not the way to go.  There is not a lot of detail remaining.  I will say that it is a creative idea.  Wish I could help more.</td>', 'Good try, I know this picture could be improved, I am just not sure how to tell you to do it.  It seems like you lightened on the computer it to compensate for underexposure in the camera, and that was not the way to go.  There is not a lot of detail remaining.  I will say that it is a creative idea.  Wish I could help more.', '2006-01-26 21:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089991, 284667, 48717, '<td valign="top">This would be a beautiful smoke shot, your composition is wonderfull as well as the focus, but your black levels have been under saturated.  I think your background should be black, but instead it is grey.  This causes you to also loose detail in the smoke.</td>', 'This would be a beautiful smoke shot, your composition is wonderfull as well as the focus, but your black levels have been under saturated.  I think your background should be black, but instead it is grey.  This causes you to also loose detail in the smoke.', '2006-01-26 21:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
