(2099949, 284191, 9747, '<td valign="top">Dreaming of falling or flight is very common, so seeing this on a photograph made me break into a grin. I can guess at how you established this shot, but would love to know how you set it up anyway. The moon is an excellent touch! I can''t see anything to criticize. Kudos on coming up with a wonderful, memorable picture!</td>', 'Dreaming of falling or flight is very common, so seeing this on a photograph made me break into a grin. I can guess at how you established this shot, but would love to know how you set it up anyway. The moon is an excellent touch! I can''t see anything to criticize. Kudos on coming up with a wonderful, memorable picture!', '2006-01-29 23:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
