(2100184, 284821, 17507, '<td valign="top">excellent shot and technically well accomplished. The only thing I would suggest is that you might bring out more of the darker tones, especially in the eye - if you could increase the clarity and depth of the whites, iris, and pupil, this would really be killer. As it is, it''s really good... just one step short of greatness (in my estimation - for whatever that''s worth). This reminds me of labuda''s ''bodhisattva.''</td>', 'excellent shot and technically well accomplished. The only thing I would suggest is that you might bring out more of the darker tones, especially in the eye - if you could increase the clarity and depth of the whites, iris, and pupil, this would really be killer. As it is, it''s really good... just one step short of greatness (in my estimation - for whatever that''s worth). This reminds me of labuda''s ''bodhisattva.''', '2006-01-30 00:21:28.000000', NULL, 0),
