(2100207, 283282, 17507, '<td valign="top">congratulations on a strong finish and your highest scoring image to date! after a closer inspection, it looks like the parts of her face (eyebrows and mouth) that conveyed sadness to me only looked like they did because of the motion blur - I was reading the downward-to-the-left dark lines as a frown or pout. weird. So I wasn''t a big fan of that, but the tree is really great. The smoothly varied tones and the rich texture are really beautiful. I hope to see more from you in the future.</td>', 'congratulations on a strong finish and your highest scoring image to date! after a closer inspection, it looks like the parts of her face (eyebrows and mouth) that conveyed sadness to me only looked like they did because of the motion blur - I was reading the downward-to-the-left dark lines as a frown or pout. weird. So I wasn''t a big fan of that, but the tree is really great. The smoothly varied tones and the rich texture are really beautiful. I hope to see more from you in the future.', '2006-01-30 00:25:06.000000', NULL, 0),
